00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:43.160 line:95%
 Ca m'intéressait pas. 

00:22:43.320 --> 00:22:45.800 line:95%
 Quand ces gens arrivent... 

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:46.960 line:95%
 "Oh !" 

